      "id": "docs_superpowers_plans_archive_2026_04_19_city_guessing_mode_discriminated_round_spec",
      "label": "Discriminated RoundSpec / GuessInput / GuessOutcome unions",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "Three minimal generalisations let a second mode coexist: tagged round/reveal types, a reducer that honours outcome.endsGame instead of hard-coding lives, and a maxRounds field. Controller owns endsGame so modes stay session-state-free.",
